  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme on Early Childhood Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver: interdisciplinary research on how to maximise the impact of existing sectoral interventions on early child development outcomes; test and adapt integrated ECD approaches in DFID priority countries; a community of practice through UK-Southern interdisciplinary partnerships; and a shared vision and strategy to shape a major research programme by December 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
